NOTICE
======

Kuukan is an independent Rust reimplementation of the Jikan REST API v4.

It is a derivative work, ported file-by-file, from:

  * Jikan REST API (jikan-rest) - https://github.com/jikan-me/jikan-rest
    Copyright (c) 2019 Jikan API
    Licensed under the MIT License.

  * Jikan PHP parser library (jikan-me/jikan v4.0.12) -
    https://github.com/jikan-me/jikan
    Copyright (c) 2018 Jikan API
    Licensed under the MIT License.

Kuukan is not affiliated with Jikan, MyAnimeList.net, or their maintainers.
The HTTP API contract (routes, query parameters, response shapes) is
intentionally compatible with Jikan v4 so existing clients keep working.
